1
00:00:00,102 --> 00:00:01,902
(Leonard:)Everything all right?

2
00:00:02,938 --> 00:00:05,208
(Penny:)Yeah. I guess.

3
00:00:05,274 --> 00:00:08,014
(Leonard:)Just tell me.

4
00:00:08,978 --> 00:00:10,148
(Penny:)It's just, when we were kissing,

5
00:00:10,212 --> 00:00:12,582
(Penny:)I couldn't help but picture
you with that other girl.

6
00:00:12,647 --> 00:00:13,577
(Leonard:)Oh, no.

7
00:00:13,648 --> 00:00:14,888
(Leonard:)No, come on.

8
00:00:14,950 --> 00:00:16,180
(Leonard:)I have a friend in you.

9
00:00:16,252 --> 00:00:18,422
(Leonard:)You said so.

10
00:00:18,487 --> 00:00:20,157
(Leonard:)You're right.
Just forget it.

11
00:00:20,222 --> 00:00:22,192
(chuckles)
Yeah.

12
00:00:25,961 --> 00:00:28,401
Okay, listen. Uh...

13
00:00:28,463 --> 00:00:31,703
(Leonard:)If you're imagining that
it was sexy, it wasn't.

14
00:00:31,767 --> 00:00:34,537
We-we were both drunk, and
she smelled like an ashtray.

15
00:00:34,603 --> 00:00:38,173
(Leonard:)The boat was moving a lot,
so I chipped her tooth.

16
00:00:38,239 --> 00:00:40,279
(Penny:)Did you feel guilty?

17
00:00:40,341 --> 00:00:42,781
(Leonard:)No, she had
dental insurance.

18
00:00:42,844 --> 00:00:47,014
(Penny:)Did you feel guilty
after kissing her?

19
00:00:47,081 --> 00:00:50,181
(Leonard:)Yes. I felt guilty as
soon as it happened.

20
00:00:50,251 --> 00:00:53,321
(Leonard:)I feel guilty
every time I see her.

21
00:00:53,388 --> 00:00:56,188
(Penny:)What do you mean,
every time you see her?

22
00:00:56,257 --> 00:00:58,187
(Leonard:)What... do I mean?

